# Enemy outpost (the dark beacon): one of the ring of enemy sites around the Base (GameMatch::tickOutposts). A prop -
# no game component, not on the network: every instance spawns its own from the same positions. The game draws its
# violet beam and makes it an enemy source of the faction layer; this file is the building and its field of darkness.
# Global: it stands far from every player, outside the SIM LOD, and only a visited entity is drawn.
# SHAPE (a placeholder on the Base's 6x6x6 m box; uniform scales of the baseshapes variants): a dark dais (the root),
# a spire, the violet crystal that floats over it INSIDE the beam, and four leaning stones on the dais corners.
